NAME                CPU(cores)   MEMORY(bytes)
api-f6c986d-44q85   1m           5Mi
api-f6c986d-t4ktj   1m           5Mi
$ kubectl get hpa api -n shorty
NAME   REFERENCE        TARGETS       MINPODS   MAXPODS   REPLICAS   AGE
api    Deployment/api   cpu: 2%/50%   2         5         2          10m
$ kubectl -n shorty describe hpa api | sed -n '/Conditions:/,$p'
Conditions:
  Type            Status  Reason            Message
  ----            ------  ------            -------
  AbleToScale     True    ReadyForNewScale  recommended size matches current size
  ScalingActive   True    ValidMetricFound  the HPA was able to successfully calculate a replica count from cpu resource utilization (percentage of request)
  ScalingLimited  True    TooFewReplicas    the desired replica count is less than the minimum replica count
  ScaledToZero    False   NotScaledToZero   the HPA controller did not scale the workload to zero
Events:
  Type     Reason                        Age                    From                       Message
  ----     ------                        ----                   ----                       -------
  Normal   SuccessfulRescale             10m                    horizontal-pod-autoscaler  New size: 3; reason: cpu resource utilization (percentage of request) above target
  Warning  FailedGetResourceMetric       7m52s                  horizontal-pod-autoscaler  failed to get cpu utilization: missing request for cpu in container api of Pod api-68d6cfff8b-kcsdq
  Warning  FailedComputeMetricsReplicas  7m52s                  horizontal-pod-autoscaler  invalid metrics (1 invalid out of 1), first error is: failed to get cpu resource metric value: failed to get cpu utilization: missing request for cpu in container api of Pod api-68d6cfff8b-kcsdq
  Warning  FailedGetResourceMetric       7m37s (x2 over 8m7s)   horizontal-pod-autoscaler  failed to get cpu utilization: unable to get metrics for resource cpu: no metrics returned from resource metrics API
  Warning  FailedComputeMetricsReplicas  7m35s (x2 over 8m7s)   horizontal-pod-autoscaler  invalid metrics (1 invalid out of 1), first error is: failed to get cpu resource metric value: failed to get cpu utilization: unable to get metrics for resource cpu: no metrics returned from resource metrics API
  Normal   SuccessfulRescale             6m5s (x2 over 9m7s)    horizontal-pod-autoscaler  New size: 4; reason: cpu resource utilization (percentage of request) above target
  Normal   SuccessfulRescale             3m50s (x2 over 6m47s)  horizontal-pod-autoscaler  New size: 3; reason: All metrics below target
  Normal   SuccessfulRescale             3m20s                  horizontal-pod-autoscaler  New size: 2; reason: All metrics below target
